    "innovation": "This paper implements a new multi-mode ice microphysical scheme in a global climate model to analyze competition among ice nucleation mechanisms, finding that heterogeneous nucleation on dust and pre-existing ice significantly reduces ice crystal numbers and induces a net cooling effect on the Earth-atmosphere system.",
