            "paragraph": "The Hamburg Aerosol Module (HAM) (Stier et al., 2005; Zhang et al., 2012) predicts the mixing state as well as aerosol number concentration and mass mixing ratio of seven aerosol modes. These seven modes are separated into four internally mixed aerosol modes and three externally mixed aerosol modes. HAM includes the major aerosol species sulfate (SU), black carbon (BC), particulate organic matter (POM), sea salt (SS) and mineral dust (DU).",
