            "target_entity_instance": "K\u00e4rcher and Lohmann (2002) turbulent vertical velocity scheme",
            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalScheme",
            "paragraph": "Current GCMs are not able to resolve small-scale variability of the vertical velocity; however, it has been shown that it is important to consider this in the context of ice nucleation (K\u00e4rcher and Lohmann, 2002). Sub-grid variability of the vertical velocity was introduced into ECHAM by adding a turbulent component, wt, based on the turbulent kinetic energy to the grid box mean value, w\u2081 (K\u00e4rcher and Lohmann, 2002): w = w\u2081 + wt = w1 + 0.7\u221aTKE",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
            "eval": true
        },
