            "target_entity_instance": "Levkov et al. (1992) contact nucleation parameterization",
            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalScheme",
            "paragraph": "Dust and black carbon can initiate ice formation in mixed-phase clouds at water saturation of 238 K< T < 273 K; externally mixed dust particles can initiate contact nucleation in the presence of supercooled water droplets following the parameterization of Levkov et al. (1992), as described in Lohmann and Diehl (2006).",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
