            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalScheme",
            "paragraph": "Internally mixed dust and black carbon particles can initiate immersion freezing in super- cooled cloud droplets, which is parameterized according to the stochastic freezing hypothesis as described in Diehl and Wurzler (2004).",
