            "target_entity_instance": "19 vertical levels",
            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalFeature",
            "paragraph": "All simulations are run over 5 years in a horizontal resolution of T42 (2.8125\u00b0 \u00d7 2.8125\u00b0) with 19 vertical levels as well as with climatological sea surface temperature and sea ice extent.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
