            "relation": "AFFECTED_REGION",
            "target_entity_instance": "Europe",
            "target_entity_type": "Continent",
            "paragraph": "In this study we have only analysed the importance of heterogeneous nucleation on cirrus clouds on a global scale. However, local phenomena such as dust outbreaks from the Sahara have been shown to affect European weather (Bangert et al., 2012).",
